Package: fonts-inter-minimal
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: fonts-inter, fonts-inter-variable
Replaces: fonts-inter
Description: Inter desktop fonts in four essential styles
 Inter is a typeface designed for legible user interfaces.
 This minimal package contains Regular, Bold, Italic and Bold Italic
 static OpenType fonts, with their complete original character coverage.
 Additional weights, Inter Display and variable fonts are omitted.
